  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>7</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>For number of real solutions, we need to find the number of times the curve cuts&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo></math>axis.</p><p>Now&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>6</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>15</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is strictly increasing function</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/bd513ca9-fee3-4c44-ae27-2ff211ea575e-image.png\" style=\"width: 100px; height: 95px;\" /></p><p>i.e. when&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mo>-</mo><mo>&#8734;</mo><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mo>-</mo><mo>&#8734;</mo></math>&nbsp;and when&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mo>&#8734;</mo><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mo>&#8734;</mo></math></p><p>So, the curve will cut&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo></math>axis only once.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo></math>&nbsp;number&nbsp;of real solution will be&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn></math></p>",
